    {
      "question": "What disclosures does a seller have to make?",
      "answer": "State law governs required seller disclosure statements, which list known defects regarding plumbing, foundations, roofs, and mechanical equipment. Federal law requires sellers of homes built before 1978 to disclose known lead paint hazards. Sellers must also provide the federal lead hazard educational pamphlet to prospective purchasers."
