    {
      "question": "What changes if I sell without an agent?",
      "answer": "Selling without an agent adds listing creation, showing security, and contract negotiation to your checklist. You must draft purchase agreements, schedule private buyer tours, and manage escrow deadlines directly. You also handle closing coordination with the title company without representation."
    },
