      "question": "What if the house is vacant or rented out?",
      "answer": "A vacant home requires regular property visits, utility maintenance, and specialized vacant-property insurance coverage. If the property houses tenants, state laws referenced on HUD tenant rights pages govern written notice periods for showings. Landlords must also observe statutory rules for security deposit returns."
    },
